### Course Import/Export API Tests
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or similar HTTP client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@authToken = YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN_HERE

### Test 1: Import Course from Markdown File
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/course/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-course.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../docs/examples/sample-course.md
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="department_id"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Test 2: Import Course from Markdown Text
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/course/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="markdown"

<!-- @course: {"code": "TEST101", "name": "Test Course", "description": "A test course", "units": 3} -->

## Module: Test Module
<!-- @module: {"order": 1, "description": "Test module"} -->

### Lesson: Test Lesson
<!-- @lesson: {"order": 1, "description": "Test lesson"} -->

This is a test lesson.

#### Test: Test Quiz
<!-- @test: {"name": "Test Quiz", "duration_mins": 30, "max_attempts": 2} -->

**Q1:** What is a variable?
- [ ] Option A
- [x] Option B (correct)
- [ ] Option C

**Explanation:** Variables store data.
**Marks:** 2
**Order:** 1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="department_id"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Test 3: Export Course (replace COURSE_ID with actual course ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/course/export?course_id=1&include_unpublished=false&include_practice_questions=true

### Test 4: Export Course with Unpublished Content
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/course/export?course_id=1&include_unpublished=true&include_practice_questions=true

### Test 5: Export Course without Practice Questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/course/export?course_id=1&include_unpublished=false&include_practice_questions=false


